{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2022-02-07 03:01:00', 'title': "SUSTAINABILITY INNOVATIONS TAKE CENTER STAGE AT EQUINIX'S NEW MUNICH DATA CENTER", 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF., FEB. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EQUINIX, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™, TODAY OPENED ITS NEW INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS EXCHANGE™ (IBX®) DATA CENTER—MU4—LOCATED IN ASCHHEIM NEAR MUNICH, GERMANY."}